{
  "id": "activation_functions",
  "field": "Computer science",
  "title": "Activation Functions",
  "audio": "/audio/bend-the-line.mp3",
  "duration": 153.9,
  "bpm": 103.4,
  "beat_offset": 0.53,
  "time_offset": 0,
  "time_scale": 1,
  "lyrics": [
    { "text": "Zee goes in and the answer comes out,", "start": 6.12, "end": 12.02, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "A function bends it, that's what it's about,", "start": 12.44, "end": 14.62, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Step was a switch, just zero or one,", "start": 14.94, "end": 16.94, "scene": "curve_dot" },
    { "text": "No slope to learn from, so learning's undone.", "start": 17.12, "end": 19.36, "scene": "curve_dot" },
    { "text": "Sigmoid squashes into zero to one,", "start": 19.88, "end": 22.12, "scene": "curve_dot" },
    { "text": "Great for a yes-or-no, the job gets done,", "start": 22.12, "end": 24.0, "scene": "curve_dot" },
    { "text": "But flat at the ends, the slope fades away,", "start": 24.24, "end": 26.42, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Learning gets slow, that's the price you pay.", "start": 26.42, "end": 28.6, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Tanh runs from minus one up to one,", "start": 28.68, "end": 31.08, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Centered on zero, so training can run,", "start": 31.08, "end": 33.38, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "It lives in recurrent cells, remembering the past,", "start": 33.38, "end": 35.8, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "But it flattens at the ends, so slopes don't last.", "start": 35.8, "end": 38.26, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Bend the line, bend the line,", "start": 38.68, "end": 41.92, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Zee goes in and the answer comes out fine,", "start": 42.98, "end": 46.7, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Same zee in, a different curve,", "start": 47.68, "end": 51.54, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Pick the bend that the job deserves.", "start": 52.18, "end": 55.68, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "ReLU is a ramp, it's simple and quick,", "start": 56.84, "end": 59.6, "scene": "curve_dot" },
    { "text": "Negative goes to zero, positives stick,", "start": 59.6, "end": 61.7, "scene": "curve_dot" },
    { "text": "Hidden layers love it, fast to compute,", "start": 61.7, "end": 64.04, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "But stuck at zero, a neuron goes mute.", "start": 64.04, "end": 66.48, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Leaky lets a little through, a small slope below,", "start": 66.94, "end": 69.1, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "So the neuron never dies, it can still grow,", "start": 69.1, "end": 71.24, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "PReLU learns that slope while it trains,", "start": 71.66, "end": 73.76, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "More freedom, more parameters, more to maintain.", "start": 73.76, "end": 75.72, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "ELU slides smoothly under zero,", "start": 94.17, "end": 96.6, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Keeps averages near zero, a gentle hero,", "start": 96.6, "end": 99.16, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "It needs an exponential, so it's slower to run,", "start": 99.56, "end": 102.82, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "But no dead neurons, the gradient lives on.", "start": 102.82, "end": 106.08, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Swish is zee times sigmoid of zee,", "start": 106.3, "end": 108.4, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Smooth with a little dip, as you can see,", "start": 108.4, "end": 110.46, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "It can beat ReLU when the network is deep,", "start": 110.48, "end": 112.42, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "A bit more to compute, but the gains you keep.", "start": 112.42, "end": 114.4, "scene": "equation_build" },
    { "text": "Sigmoid for the last layer when the answer's yes or no,", "start": 114.4, "end": 117.4, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Tanh inside recurrent cells, where the memories flow,", "start": 117.4, "end": 120.6, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "ReLU for hidden layers, it's the default, it's true,", "start": 120.6, "end": 124.72, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Leaky or Swish when the plain ones won't do.", "start": 125.06, "end": 127.24, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Bend the line, bend the line,", "start": 127.7, "end": 131.3, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Zee goes in and the answer comes out fine,", "start": 132.4, "end": 136.08, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Same zee in, a different curve,", "start": 137.04, "end": 140.8, "scene": "flow_boxes" },
    { "text": "Pick the bend that the job deserves.", "start": 141.66, "end": 145.08, "scene": "flow_boxes" }
  ],
